# Candidate-only graphics startup; original BSP RC and module remain retained.
# The identical module is copied into vendor so its vendor_file label matches
# the existing init module_load policy. ueventd creates the actual device node;
# do not run a root toolbox mknod or assume a fixed misc minor number.
on post-fs-data
    insmod /vendor/modules/mali_kbase.ko
    setprop vold.decrypt trigger_restart_framework

# The bringup wake lock is acquired by the trusted ramdisk before policy load.
# No unauthenticated serial shell or root graphics diagnostic service here.
